top-sort [i_item_id asc, s_state asc] limit 100
└─ project (i_item_id, s_state, g_state, agg1, agg2, agg3, agg4) (rows≈3 cost≈19.8K)
   └─ aggregate keys=[item.i_item_id, store.s_state] aggs=[sum_0=sum, count_0=count, sum_1=sum, count_1=count, sum_2=sum, count_2=count, sum_3=sum, count_3=count] (rows≈3 cost≈19.6K)
      └─ project (item.i_item_id, store.s_state, store_sales.ss_quantity, store_sales.ss_list_price, store_sales.ss_coupon_amt, store_sales.ss_sales_price) (rows≈1 cost≈19.3K)
         └─ join inner [store_sales.ss_store_sk = store.s_store_sk] (rows≈1 cost≈19.2K)
            ├─ join inner [item.i_item_sk = store_sales.ss_item_sk] emit-filter 1 from right (rows≈1 cost≈14.5K)
            │  ├─ source item AS item use-filter 1 keys=[item.i_item_sk] (rows≈10 cost≈200)
            │  └─ join inner [store_sales.ss_cdemo_sk = customer_demographics.cd_demo_sk] (rows≈1 cost≈10.1K)
            │     ├─ join inner [date_dim.d_date_sk = store_sales.ss_sold_date_sk] (rows≈1 cost≈4.8K)
            │     │  ├─ filter (== |date_dim.d_year| 1998) (rows≈10 cost≈160)
            │     │  │  └─ source date_dim AS date_dim row-groups (== |date_dim.d_year| 1998) (rows≈10 cost≈80)
            │     │  └─ source store_sales AS store_sales (rows≈10 cost≈440)
            │     └─ filter (&& (&& (== |customer_demographics.cd_gender| (cast "F" <named StringView>)) (== |customer_demographics.cd_marital_status| (cast "W" <named StringView>))) (== |customer_demographics.cd_education_status| (cast "Primary" <named StringView>))) (rows≈1 cost≈1K)
            │        └─ source customer_demographics AS customer_demographics row-groups (&& (&& (== |customer_demographics.cd_education_status| (cast "Primary" <named StringView>)) (== |customer_demographics.cd_gender| (cast "F" <named StringView>))) (== |customer_demographics.cd_marital_status| (cast "W" <named StringView>))) (rows≈10 cost≈520)
            └─ filter (call qdb_in_list |store.s_state| (cast "TN" <named StringView>) (cast "TN" <named StringView>) (cast "TN" <named StringView>) (cast "TN" <named StringView>) (cast "TN" <named StringView>) (cast "TN" <named StringView>)) (rows≈3 cost≈400)
               └─ source store AS store row-groups (call qdb_in_list |store.s_state| (cast "TN" <named StringView>) (cast "TN" <named StringView>) (cast "TN" <named StringView>) (cast "TN" <named StringView>) (cast "TN" <named StringView>) (cast "TN" <named StringView>)) (rows≈10 cost≈200)
